# Force LF in the working tree on every platform.
#
# This is load-bearing, not cosmetic. The freeze protocol hashes the raw bytes of
# config/twin.yaml (see eval/freeze_thresholds.py), and the simulator's
# determinism guarantee depends on byte-identical output. If git normalised line
# endings to CRLF on a Windows checkout, the config hash would differ from the
# frozen record and `python -m eval.run_holdout` would correctly -- but very
# confusingly -- refuse to run on a fresh clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

*.png    binary
*.joblib binary
